@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Website Development

[*] --> NavigationBar

state "Navigation Bar" as NavigationBar
state "Project Info" as ProjectInfo
state "View Photos" as ViewPhotos
state "Watch Videos" as WatchVideos
state "Career Opportunities" as CareerOpportunities
state "Updates" as Updates
state "Application Form" as ApplicationForm
state "Job Applications" as JobApplications

NavigationBar --> ProjectInfo : Select project
ProjectInfo --> ViewPhotos : Choose photos
ProjectInfo --> WatchVideos : Choose videos
ProjectInfo --> NavigationBar : Back to navigation bar

NavigationBar --> CareerOpportunities : Select career opportunities
CareerOpportunities --> Updates : Choose updates
CareerOpportunities --> ApplicationForm : Open application form
ApplicationForm --> JobApplications : Submit job applications
JobApplications --> [*] : Check submitted job applications

Updates --> NavigationBar : Back to navigation bar
ApplicationForm --> NavigationBar : Back to navigation bar

@enduml
